        "content": "Listening Passage 1",
        "explanations": [],
        "questions": [],
        "vocabs": [
          {
            "id": 882181,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882182,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SALLY: Good morning."
              },
              {
                "id": 882186,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Hinchingbrooke Country Park, Sally speaking.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 58.184998,
                  "from": 56.505,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 0"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882192,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’m one of the rangers."
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882199,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882200,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: Oh hello."
              },
              {
                "id": 882203,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "My name’s John Chapman, and I’m a teaching assistant at a local primary school."
              },
              {
                "id": 882216,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’ve been asked to arrange a visit to the park for two of our classes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 119.37,
                  "from": 118.01,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882231,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882232,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SALLY: OK. What would you like to know?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 121.85,
                  "from": 119.61,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882241,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882242,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: Well, I’m new to this area, so perhaps you could tell me something about the park first, please.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 129.785,
                  "from": 122.745,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882261,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882262,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SALLY: Of course.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 130.82501,
                  "from": 129.94499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882266,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Altogether the park covers 170 acres, that’s 69 hectares.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 135.065,
                  "from": 131.385,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882275,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There are three main types of habitat: wetland, grassland and woodland.",
                "youpass_pick_words": [
                  "wetland"
                ],
                "meta": {
                  "to": 144.5,
                  "from": 138.57999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882287,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The woods are well established and varied, with an oak plantation, and other areas of mixed species.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 152.145,
                  "from": 144.9,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882304,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882305,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: Right.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 153.18501,
                  "from": 152.145,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882307,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882308,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SALLY: The wetland is quite varied, too.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 155.90501,
                  "from": 153.345,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882315,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The original farmland was dug up around 40 years ago to extract gravel.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 161.585,
                  "from": 156.38501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882329,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Once this work was completed, the gravel pits filled with water, forming the two large lakes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 169.23001,
                  "from": 162.51001,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882346,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There are also several smaller ones, ponds and a stream that flows through the park.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 176.03,
                  "from": 169.71,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882361,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882362,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: OK, so I suppose with these different habitats there’s quite a variety of wildlife.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 184.015,
                  "from": 176.415,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882376,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882377,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SALLY: There certainly is - a lot of different species of birds and insects, and also animals like deer and rabbits.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 193.29001,
                  "from": 184.015,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882395,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882396,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: And I understand you organise educational visits for school parties.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 198.41,
                  "from": 193.53,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882407,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882408,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SALLY: That’s right.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 199.69,
                  "from": 198.48999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882411,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We can organise a wide range of activities and adapt them to suit all ages.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 205.53,
                  "from": 200.17,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882426,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882427,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: Can you give me some examples of the activities?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 209.225,
                  "from": 206.025,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882437,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882438,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SALLY: Well, one focus is on science, where we help children to discover and study plants, trees and insects.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 217.70499,
                  "from": 209.70499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882457,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "They also collect and analyse data about the things they see.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 223.25,
                  "from": 218.53,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882469,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882470,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: Uhuh.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 223.97,
                  "from": 223.25,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882473,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882474,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SALLY: Another focus is on geography.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 226.61,
                  "from": 223.97,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882481,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The park is a great environment to learn and practise reading a map and using a compass to navigate around the park.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 235.87502,
                  "from": 227.25,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882501,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882502,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: Do you do anything connected with history?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 239.715,
                  "from": 236.27501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882510,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882511,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SALLY: Yes, we do.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 241.23502,
                  "from": 239.715,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882515,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "For instance, the children can explore how the use of the land has changed over time.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 247.395,
                  "from": 241.63501,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882532,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882533,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: Then there’s leisure and tourism.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 250.33,
                  "from": 248.33,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882539,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882540,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SALLY: That focuses on your visitors, I would imagine.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 254.48999,
                  "from": 250.33,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882549,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882550,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: Yes, mostly.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 255.85,
                  "from": 254.48999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882553,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The children find out about them, their requirements, the problems they may cause and how we manage these.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 263.655,
                  "from": 256.41,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882572,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And another subject we cover is music: here the children experiment with natural materials to create sounds and explore rhythm and tempo.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 275.655,
                  "from": 264.29498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882595,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882596,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: That must be fun!",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 277.41,
                  "from": 275.97,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882601,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882602,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SALLY: Most children really enjoy it.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 279.97,
                  "from": 277.49,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882608,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And of course, all the activities are educational, too.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 320.39,
                  "from": 316.15,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882618,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Learning outside the classroom encourages children to be creative, and to explore and discover for themselves.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 329.36502,
                  "from": 321.125,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882635,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882636,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: I would imagine they get a sense of freedom that might not be a normal part of their lives.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 335.605,
                  "from": 329.445,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882654,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882655,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SALLY: That’s right.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 199.69,
                  "from": 198.48999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882658,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And very often the children discover that they can do things they didn’t know they could do, and they develop new skills.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 345.29,
                  "from": 337.37,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882681,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "This gives them greater self-confidence.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 348.17,
                  "from": 346.01,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882687,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882688,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: It sounds great.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 350.185,
                  "from": 348.745,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882692,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So, what about the practical side of it?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 354.585,
                  "from": 351.145,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882701,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "How much does it cost for a full-day visit?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 358.105,
                  "from": 354.745,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882710,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We would expect to bring between 30 and 40 children.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 362.745,
                  "from": 358.505,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882719,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882720,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SALLY: If there are over 30, it costs £4.95 for each child who attends on the day.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 371.25,
                  "from": 363.09,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882738,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "We invoice you afterwards, so you don’t pay for children who can’t come because of sickness, for example.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 378.29,
                  "from": 371.72998,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882757,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There’s no charge for leaders and other adults - as many as you want to bring.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 384.92502,
                  "from": 379.165,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882773,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882774,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: That sounds very fair.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 386.92502,
                  "from": 384.92502,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882779,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Well, thanks for all the information.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 390.125,
                  "from": 387.565,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882786,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’ll need to discuss it with my colleagues, and I hope to get back to you soon to make a booking.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 396.69,
                  "from": 390.365,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882807,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882808,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "SALLY: We’ll look forward to hearing from you.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 399.01,
                  "from": 396.77002,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 882817,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Goodbye.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 399.89,
                  "from": 399.33002,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 882820,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 882821,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "JOHN: Goodbye, and thank you.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 402.29,
                  "from": 400.13,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "listen_from": 0,
        "listen_to": 472,
        "question_sets": [
